## Competitive positioning

Most SEO tools typically focus on a specific area, such as keyword research, backlink analysis, or rank tracking. Enterprise platforms typically add workflow governance, multi-team reporting, and collaboration capabilities, but operate as closed systems. AI-native tools focus specifically on visibility in AI-generated answers.
Semrush brings these disciplines together in a single platform powered by a shared proprietary dataset. It unifies SEO and AI search optimization within a single workflow, connects competitive intelligence across organic search, paid media, content marketing, social media, local marketing, and AI search, and supports organizations ranging from individual marketers and small businesses to global enterprises. The platform scales from self-serve subscriptions to fully configured enterprise deployments, eliminating the need to manage multiple disconnected point solutions.
